	print("  1. A 'PoiBuilder' toolbar row sits BELOW the scene toolbar at all times,")
	print("     even with nothing selected — context buttons grey until a PBMesh is")
	print("     selected. Move/Rotate/Scale | Object/Vertex/Edge/Face | Space | op")
	print("     buttons (Extrude/Inset/Loop Cut/Merge/Subdiv/Weld/Detach/Del) |")
	print("     New Shape + Edit Params | Panel toggle.")
	print("  2. Selecting PBCube enables the row. Ops enable per selection context")
	print("     (e.g. Extrude needs a face selection; Loop Cut an edge; Weld 2+")
	print("     verts) and stay grey otherwise.")
	print("")
	print("Overlay panel (compact readouts + params modal, v0.9.0 redesign):")
